      "sourceText": "MID360 固定在 `gimbal_yaw`，雷达→yaw 云台层的安装关系固定；雷达→底盘关系则包含实际机械 yaw，随关节角变化。实际 pitch 在 `gimbal_pitch_joint`，位于雷达挂载层之后，不应进入雷达到这两个目标系的机械变换。两个 odom 关节保持固定，JointState 继续使用 `{relative_pitch, relative_yaw, 0, 0}`。",
      "translatedText": "The MID360 is fixed at `gimbal_yaw`\\. The installation relationship from the LiDAR to the yaw gimbal layer is fixed; the LiDAR\\-to\\-chassis relationship includes the actual mechanical yaw and varies with the joint angle\\. The actual pitch is at `gimbal_pitch_joint`\\. It is located after the LiDAR mounting layer and should not enter the mechanical transformation from the LiDAR to these two target frames\\. The two odom joints remain fixed, and JointState continues to use `{relative_pitch, relative_yaw, 0, 0}`\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 201,
